  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 70863 and TMDB show 28136. AniDB S1 \"抜刀斎名勝負侬\" (Review Special) has no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E1 is \"End of Wanderings: The Bond of Scarlet and Azure is in the Sound of the Sea\", another item); AniDB S2 \"飛天御剣流: 剣技大全\" (\"Special Techniques\" Special) is TVDB S0E13 \"Rurouni Kenshin: Special Techniques\" and has no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E2 is \"Trust \u0026 Betrayal: Act 1 - The Man of the Slashing Sword\", another item); AniDB S3 \"夏休みスペシャル 京都決戦クライマックス！\" (Episode 56b - Summer Special) has no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E3 is \"Trust \u0026 Betrayal: Act 2 - The Lost Cat\", another item); AniDB S4 \"流浪の最果て・緋と瑠璃の絆は潮騒の中に\" (End of Wanderings) is TMDB S0E1 \"流浪の最果て・緋と瑠璃の絆は潮騒の中に\" (End of Wanderings: The Bond of Scarlet and Azure is in the Sound of the Sea); AniDB S5-S6 (\"~第一章~ 東京編\" (The First Chapter: The Tokyo Book) to \"~第二章~ 京都編\" (The Second Chapter: The Kyoto Book)) have no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items); AniDB S7-S9 (\"Memorial DVD Box Special Ending\" to \"Production Art\") have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items) and no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items); AniDB S10-S12 (\"Character Song 1 MV: Journey (Soujirou`s Theme)\" to \"Character Song 3 MV: Kono Sekai no Katasumi de... (Kenshin and Kaoru`s Theme)\") have no TVDB episode (TVDB has none of them) and no TMDB episode (TMDB has none of them); AniDB S13 \"飛天巫剣流 剣術型録\" (Episode S13) has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E13 is \"Rurouni Kenshin: Special Techniques\", another item) and no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E13).",
